WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.762
You finish a project, send the invoice, and realize you
need to find the next client all over again.

00:00:05.822 --> 00:00:07.188
The work is good.

00:00:07.248 --> 00:00:09.681
The path to the next sale is unclear.

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:13.238
Maybe you coach people who keep asking for free advice.

00:00:13.298 --> 00:00:16.766
Maybe your videos get views but brands rarely inquire.

00:00:16.826 --> 00:00:20.936
Or you design solid work, send custom quotes, and hear
nothing back.

00:00:20.997 --> 00:00:24.214
Start by asking where people stop moving forward.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.983
How do they find you?

00:00:26.043 --> 00:00:28.370
What happens after they show interest?

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.102
Do they know what to buy?

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:33.050
And once the work is done, what happens next?

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.481
The Authority Flywheel gives each step a job.

00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:40.355
Attract the right people with useful content.

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:43.047
Engage them with a follow-up that helps.

00:00:43.107 --> 00:00:46.355
Convert qualified prospects with a clear offer.

00:00:46.415 --> 00:00:50.814
Ascend by turning good delivery into repeat work,
referrals, and proof.

00:00:52.414 --> 00:00:56.611
Picture a designer who posts a packaging teardown and
shares a brief.

00:00:56.671 --> 00:01:01.466
A founder downloads it, sees a useful example, and books a
fit call.

00:01:01.526 --> 00:01:06.031
After delivery, an approved before-and-after becomes the
next teardown.

00:01:06.091 --> 00:01:07.278
That is the loop.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:17.602
Inside the playbook you get three worked service
businesses, five complete emails to adapt, a sales call
script, four worksheets, and a 30-day build plan.

00:01:17.662 --> 00:01:19.940
This is not a get-rich-quick scheme.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.962
You will need to talk to buyers, publish the work, and
follow up.

00:01:24.022 --> 00:01:28.106
The system gives each of those efforts a place and
something you can improve.

00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:33.241
If you want to find your starting point first, take the
free diagnostic below.

00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:40.135
When you are ready to build, get the Authority Flywheel
Playbook for fifteen thousand Rwandan francs.

